# NOTE: sandboxes analysis, build declare a
# hostname egress allowlist. A firewall rule works on IP
# ranges and service accounts, not FQDNs, so the allowlist is
# enforced by an egress proxy / Cloud NAT with an FQDN policy,
# wired in overlays/ -- not by these rules (ADR-0084).
